## Copyleft

In addition to the notices rule, if you make changes to this software and make your changes available to others, you must make your changes available to everyone under this license or another PolyForm Noncommercial License.

## Noncommercial Purposes

Any purpose is a noncommercial purpose, except for:

1. purposes essentially directed toward or toward obtaining commercial advantage for you or others

2. purposes essentially directed toward or toward obtaining monetary compensation for you or others

3. company activities, other than company activities that are research, test, or development activities that will not be incorporated into products or services that will be distributed or provided to others

4. software or other material produced for or by a company, other than software or other material produced for or by a company for research, test, or development activities that will not be incorporated into products or services that will be distributed or provided to others

5. providing this software to others as a service, including any service that provides access to this software

6. developing or supporting software or other materials that will be provided to others as a service, including any service that provides access to this software

7. any activity that is part of a series of activities that includes any purpose described in rules 1 through 6

